- Nenek Chen!
- Nenek Chen!

28:39.520 --> 28:40.760
Hong Xu!

28:40.840 --> 28:41.880
Bagaimana?

28:41.960 --> 28:42.960
Tak nampak dia.

28:43.040 --> 28:44.560
Dia tiada di belah utara.

28:44.640 --> 28:46.080
Chen Maidong!

28:46.560 --> 28:47.680
Kenapa awak datang?

28:47.760 --> 28:48.960
Kenapa tak beritahu saya?

28:49.040 --> 28:51.080
Awak sukar berjalan. Awak akan risau saja.

28:51.640 --> 28:52.800
Kenapa fikir begitu?

28:53.280 --> 28:56.560
- Nenek Chen!
- Nenek Chen!

